          "sectionId": 22006
        }
      ],
      "title": "未定的预言·Ⅰ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "22007001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "汽水罐，哈莉找到了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22007002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "那么就让拉斐尔先试着对着它使用能力？我们看看能画出什么。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22007003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "嗯！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22007004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "拉斐尔？听得到吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22007005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "唔！这就是拉斐尔使用那特殊能力的状态吗，好像外界什么都听不见了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22007006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "等等，你们看那边！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22007007",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "是刚才那只坏猫猫，它又出现了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22007008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "刚才被赶跑了，但又没有完全跑掉，一直都在旁边盯着我们吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22007009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "果然是只坏猫，竟然在这种时候搅局。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22007010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "它又跑过来了！哈莉，我们保护好拉斐尔。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22008001",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "不过它好像不是冲着我们来的？——唔！！糟了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22008002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "现在怎么办？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22008003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "真糟糕，不小心将猫画进去了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22008004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "这就是恶猫有恶报吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22008005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "之前那只坏猫猫，可是很嚣张的差点伤到了拉斐尔。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22008006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "正好现在帮拉斐尔试验能力，就当它之前做那些坏事的补偿好了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22008007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "但是它的情况好像不太对劲。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22008008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "是被厄运带来的意外影响了吗，它看上去很虚弱，很难受。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22008009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "它好像完全瘫软在地上了……这样子是吃了什么东西闹坏肚子了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22008010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "我们跟过去看看。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22008011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "不论是为了验证试验，还是保证那只猫的安全……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-463",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "meishumei",
